"""
BIX-42-Q2 — Skewness of RNA expression distribution (TCGA COAD geneExp)

Primary unit  : pooled distribution of all gene x sample values (raw scale)
Complement    : per-gene summary and log2(x+1) diagnostic
Outputs       : console summary, artifacts/skewness_*.svg, artifacts/histogram_table.csv
"""
